            "line": 623,
            "text": "theorem forward_eq_backward_iff {R : ℝ → ℝ} {r : ℝ} (hr : 0 < r)\n    (hi : IntegrableOn (fun u => u ^ 2 * R u) (Ioi 0)) :\n    forwardStress R r = backwardStress R r ↔ (∫ u in Ioi (0 : ℝ), u ^ 2 * R u) = 0"
